#subtitle: Building ties with our international allies

Our party's peculiar ideological makeup connects it both with the <span style="color:blue">Radical</span> and <span style="color:green">Green</span> internationals.

- @prrrs: Build relationships with the French PRRRS and the British Liberals and try to influence the French and British governments to our favor.
- @second_international: Contact the <span style="color:#c00000">Labor and Socialist International</span> to initiate closer cooperation with the labor movement.
- @peasants: Learn peasant organising from the International Agrarian Bureau.
- @dvp: Contact the DVP.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

